              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To access your account on **PreLicenseTraining.com**, choose the login portal that matches your account type below:\n\n### 1. Student Login (Insurance & CE Students)\nIf you are taking pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses, use the student portal:\n* **Go to the login page:** [PreLicenseTraining Student Account Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login).\n* **Login Details:** Your **Login Name** is usually the email address you used to register (unless you manually changed it inside your account settings).\n\n### 2. Mentor & Recruiter Login\nIf you are a manager, trainer, or recruiter tracking student progress:\n* **Go to the login page:** [PreLicenseTraining Mentor Portal Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login).\n\n---\n\n### Forgot Your Password or Login Name?\nIf you are having trouble accessing your student account, use these recovery options:\n* **Forgot Password:** Reset it on the [PreLicenseTraining Forgot Password Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot_password). You will need to enter your registered email address to receive reset instructions.\n* **Forgot Login Name:** Recover your username on the [PreLicenseTraining Forgot Login Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot_login). You can search using either your email and password, or your first name, last name, and password.\n\n### Still Need Help?\nIf you are locked out or need further assistance, you can contact support directly:\n* **Support Phone Number:** 1 (800) 780-2113",
